  "website": "https://www.pickyourown.org/AME2email.php?ADDT=UPDN&amp;EN=Pippin+Apple+Orchard&amp;ES=RI&amp;EC=Providence+County&amp;EP=+401-943-7096&amp;ECT=Cranston&amp;EZ=&amp;EA=751+Pippin+Orchard+Road&amp;EA2=&amp;EW=https%3A%2F%2Fpippinorchard.com&amp;RD=NR&amp;EF=PippinOrchard&amp;EM=No+match.+&amp;EX=US&amp;PG=RInorth.htm&amp;OP=July+to+December%2C+every+day%2C+9+am+to+5+pm%3B%3B+&amp;IG=&amp;TW=&amp;DS=.Orchard+is+over+17+acres+and+is+famously+known+as+one+of+the+best+kept+and+groomed+orchards+in+New+England.+We+do+not+use+any+herbicides.+We+grow+Macintosh%2C+Empire%2C+Cortland%2C+Gala%2C+Honeycrisp%2C+Macoun%2C+Jonagold%2C+and+Red+Delicious.+%28UPDATED%3A+June+29%2C+2025%2C+JBS%29+Comments+from+a+visitor+on+September+11%2C+2011%3A+%22Every+year+my+family+and+I+have+gone+apple+picking+at+Pippin+Orchards.+Over+the+last+few+years+we%27ve+become+a+little+wary+about+going+there+as+the+workers+have+been+very+strict+about+where+you+can+pick+and+about+using+the+poles+for+reaching+the+apples+up+high.+This+year+was+absolutely+ridiculous.+First+we+were+told+that+the+Cortland+apples+%22weren%27t+ready%22+this+week%2C+but+that+they+would+be+ready+next+week.+Another+employee+ended+up+confirming+that+some+were+ready+on+one+end+of+the+farm+so+we+could+pick+there.+Really%3F+How+can+it+be+that+those+trees+are+ready+and+the+others+are+not%3F+We+asked+for+the+pole+pickers+so+we+could+get+apples+of+any+kind+of...&amp;DR=Located+in+Providence+County+and+I+think+their+should+be+a+disclaimer+following+there+info+about+apple+picking",
